# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and adjust as needed.
#
# Extra footer content rendered below the copyright line — one line per entry,
# injected into the page at container start (docker/entrypoint.sh).
#
# Formats:
#   1. A JSON array of { title, url } objects (recommended — each entry
#      renders as a link, no raw HTML needed):
#      FOOTER_EXTRA=[{"title":"ICP filing number","url":"https://beian.miit.gov.cn/"}]
#   2. A JSON array of raw-HTML strings (kept for compatibility).
#   3. A single raw-HTML string.
#
# Keep the value on a single line; lines starting with "#" are comments.
#
# Chinese ICP filing line — replace the placeholder with the registered
# number before deploying; append more entries (e.g. 网安备案) later:
FOOTER_EXTRA=[{"title":"ICP filing number","url":"https://beian.miit.gov.cn/"}]
